# voidwell: the development desktop (Ryzen 9 9950X3D). No deploy target: the live world
# runs from this checkout, through scripts/run-live.sh voidwell, and a person's own
# scripts/run-voxel.sh window keeps to the same CPUs.

# The V-cache chiplet (96 MB L3; CPUs 8-15, 24-31 have 32 MB and are the agents'). Cache
# study D (design/handoffs/voxel-cache-and-pinning-2026-09-24.md): the terrarium's water
# tick took 1.64 / 2.50 ms (steady / shower) on this chiplet's threads against
# 2.02 / 3.04 ms over both chiplets.
RUN_CPUS=0-7,16-23
RUN_ARGS="voxel --config config/desktop/terrarium.toml --sink gpu --gpu-target window --fps 60"
# No STATE: the desktop world is not persisted, as before.
